{
  "title": "Duplicate URLSession setup between RamekinAPI and InsecureSession",
  "description": "`RamekinAPI` creates its own `urlSession` with a fresh \
`InsecureSessionDelegate` (Shared/RamekinAPI.swift:10-13), while \
`Shared/InsecureSession.swift` exports a top-level `insecureSession` with \
another fresh delegate used by the generated OpenAPI builders. Two sessions, \
two delegates, two cache/cookie stores, for identical behavior. Expose a \
single shared session (ideally reused by the image loader too) and have both \
builder factory and handwritten calls pick it up.",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 3,
  "type": "task",
  "labels": [
    "ios",
  ],
